+// Launcher updates. First the pure logic (manifest, decisions), then the work itself: the install's
+// layout, hidden processes (curl, Update.ps1 / update.sh) and the hand-off. No dependency on the rest
+// of the runtime, so the test compiles this file standalone; launcher.cpp draws it.
